an%20identifier%20%60typedef%60%29%20is%20not%20taken%0A%20%2A%20there%20even%20when%20only%20it%20would%20let%20the%20parse%20go%20on.%20A%20parse%20records%20the%0A%20%2A%20spans%20where%20a%20keyword%20token%20matched%20%28%60matched%60%29%2C%20each%20with%20the%20rule%20calls%20it%0A%20%2A%20matched%20in%3B%20a%20leaf%20of%20a%20token%20rule%20in%20its%20tree%20over%20such%20a%20span%20%28%60lexed%60%2C%0A%20%2A%20the%20rule%27s%20kind%2C%20which%20an%20alias%20keeps%29%20that%20the%20keyword%20outranks%20%28see%0A%20%2A%20%60tokenConflict%60%29%20makes%20the%20span%20keyword-only%20%28%60only%60%29%2C%20and%20the%20input%20is%0A%20%2A%20parsed%20again%2C%20where%20no%20token%20rule%20takes%20a%20keyword-only%20span%20the%20keyword%0A%20%2A%20outranks%20it%20on.%20The%20spans%20only%20grow%2C%20so%20the%20reparses%20end.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20The%20keyword%20counts%20only%20where%20it%20matched%20in%20the%20tree%27s%20parse%20state%3A%20in%20a%0A%20%2A%20call%20made%2C%20through%20some%20chain%20of%20calls%20up%20to%20the%20first%2C%20by%20calls%20that%20build%0A%20%2A%20nodes%20each%20beginning%20a%20node%20of%20the%20tree%20that%20goes%20on%20past%20the%20span%2C%20as%20the%0A%20%2A%20items%20a%20parser%20has%20in%20progress%20there.%20A%20chain%20through%20a%20call%20that%20began%20no%0A%20%2A%20such%20node%20lexed%20the%20text%20before%20the%20span%20otherwise%20%28Rust%27s%20%60m%21%28%27%22%27%29%60%2C%20whose%0A%20%2A%20token%20tree%20also%20takes%20%60%27%60%20alone%20and%20a%20string%20to%20the%20next%20%60%22%60%2C%20where%20a%20later%0A%20%2A%20%60_%60%20type%20is%20a%20keyword%20%60_%60%20token%29%3A%20the%20tree%27s%20parse%20never%20reached%20that%20state.%0A%20%2A%20A%20call%27s%20result%20is%20shared%20by%20every%20call%20that%20made%20it%2C%20so%20every%20chain%20counts.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20An%20immediate%20token%20a%20literal%20%28%60%28immediateToken%20%28literal%20%5B%29%29%60%29%20outranks%20the%0A%20%2A%20plain%20literal%20of%20the%20same%20t